{title: Kadam}
{artist: Prateek Kuhad}
{key: G}

{c: Verse 1}
[G] [C] [Em],        Main kadam kadam
[Bm] [Em] [G],        Badalta hoon yanhi
[C] [Em] [Bm] [Em] [C],        Ye zindgi baldalti hi nahi
[Am] [C] [G],        Hai lafzon ki kami
[G] [C] [Em],        Main idhar udhar
[Bm] [Em] [G],        Fisalta hi raha
[C] [Em] [Bm] [Em] [C],        Ye man kabhi sambhalta hi nahi
[Am] [C] [G],        Hoon yaadon mein chupa
[G] [C] [Em],        Ye shaam kaise rang si hai
[G] [Am] [Em],        Uddti utarati patang si hai
[G] [C] [Em],        Main kal ki raahon mein hoon phasaa
[Am] [D] [G],        Ye waqt bhi mujhe bhulaa gaya
